  "title": "Qualify immutable Math IR local NuGet publisher with exact published Quantities dependency in a disposable feed",
  "commitMessage": "test: qualify IR immutable local NuGet publisher rehearsal",
  "timeoutSeconds": 1800,
  "projectNodes": [
    "M7"
  ],
  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify a Math IR local publisher controller by rehearsing an exact dependent NuGet archive in a disposable feed, with fifteen independent binary checks and immutable publication refusals.",
    "value": "Reuse the published Dw.Tools.NuGet no-overwrite publisher for an actual linked-source IR package with one pinned Quantities dependency; verify archive and DLL hashes, collision, digest and cancellation refusals, and a fresh source-free consumer.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "RS145 qualifies a disposable-feed release rehearsal only; the original RS144 candidate must not be implicitly published to NUGET_LOCAL.",
      "Rehearsal archive/DLL fingerprints can differ from original RS144; a later owner --publish action must require exact original 21926 bytes.",
      "The original six IR sources, ProjectReference, historical Version, all RS134-RS144 receipts and published base package remain unchanged.",
      "Public licensing, package README/notices, other RID/OS consumers, installed rollback, crash recovery and Discovery/Decision/AURA admission remain outside this gate."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After RS145 succeeds, inspect original 21926-byte IR candidate, rights and hashes. Separately use guarded --publish and --verify from clean main, then prepare a read-only independent DWF physical-feed qualification.",
    "achievements": []
  },
